#! program build/docs-examples/bin/tut12_field
#! args    --examples /tmp/figure-studio --case /tmp/figure-studio/plate
#! frames  560
#! poster  470
# F5 runs the solver; the Result panel comes forward with the field in cividis, its legend and contour lines; the
# probe line is dragged towards the hot side (the profile follows), the probe point moved; batlow, in 8 bands; jet,
# with its warning (the solver runs in real time: the frames start once it has surely ended)
